":34},{"name":"Environmental Concept Art & Design","id":5}],"software_items":[{"icon_url":"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/softwares/icons/000/000/008/default/blender_icon_1024x1024.png?1570478232","name":"Blender"}],"id":22645561,"user_id":14054932,"title":"Small Low Polly Island ","description":"<p>Hi everyone!</p>\n\n<p>Here is my second original 3D piece as an aspiring 3D modeller. I really love the low poly art style, so I made a small island out at sea with a rowboat, and a bit of mystery... why is the rowboat there, and where is the person who sailed it?</p>\n\n<p>Made in Blender.</p>\n\n<p>If you have any tips or feedback to share, I’d greatly appreciate it!</p>","description_html":"<p>Hi everyone!\n<br />Here is my second original 3D piece as an aspiring 3D modeller. I really love the low poly art style, so I made a small island out at sea with a rowboat, and a bit of mystery... why is the rowboat there, and where is the person who sailed it?\n<br />Made in Blender.\n<br />If you have any tips or feedback to share, I’d greatly appreciate it!</p>","created_at":"2026-07-22T13:22:12.756-05:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T13:22:12.767-05:00","views_count":6,"likes_count":2,"comments_count":0,"permalink":"https://www.artstation.com/artwork/5e8JBJ","cover_url":"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/100/998/966/medium/james-hutt-ocean-island.jpg?1784743820","published_at":"2026-07-22T13:22:12.745-05:00","editor_pick":false,"adult_content":false,"admin_adult_content":false,"slug":"small-low-polly-island","suppressed":false,"hash_id":"5e8JBJ","visible":true,"is_promotional":false}